Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:18.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa mentioned that you were living in a luxurious house, Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom got immersed in a cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the valuables in our house were given to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She also incurred a huge debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:36.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Therefore, my parents voluntarily divorced toward the end of last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:40.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My father has custody of me, and we have both lived here since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.12,0:02:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't help you. I will, however, lend you my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:48.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and please make a trip home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you get there, I ask that you cleanse your body with holy water and change into a set of pure clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:57.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does meeting me back here around midnight sound all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can do that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:07.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:09.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not saying you'll help me for free, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if it makes you feel better, I guess I can charge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How does 100,000 yen sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:27.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,100,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:30.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You treat her extremely differently from how you treated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:31.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:34.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As I recall, the price I quoted for the class representative was also 100,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You asked me for a whopping 5,000,000 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:40.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that was a vampire, you know. It couldn't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't blame anything and everything on the vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:49.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what I might have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,100,000 yen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've finished taking a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:12.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you get out of the way?\NI can't get to my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clothes! Put on your clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:19.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that you should have put something on before you stepped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot to carry them in with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then at least cover yourself with a towel or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to do something that a poor person would do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first time that I've seen a girl completely nude...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:39.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pure clothes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:41.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think he'd prefer white clothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:42.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:50.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have any bras or panties that don't have patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:52.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:56.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't gotten aroused from seeing me nude, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I have, it wouldn't be my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:05.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Done. You can turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:07.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your motive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:14.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:17.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a special service as a reward for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should at least be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:22.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be a little bit happy, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:23.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should be getting mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:26.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should at least give me a critique as a courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A critique...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.12,0:05:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You have a nice figure... How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:40.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's exactly why you will forever be a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forever?!\NDid you come from the future?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please refrain from spitting.\NI'll be infected by your virginity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:49.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a man's virginity could spread to a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold up... Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:55.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The topic is proceeding on the assumption that I am a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:58.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true that my words are biased.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:06:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:03.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just don't spit.\NYour amateurish virginity will infect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:06.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I admit it.\NI {\i1}am{\i0} a virgin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:10.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll keep this a secret from Hanekawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:14.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:18.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't she the girl you have a crush on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:19.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys talk frequently, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just because Hanekawa is honestly the type that looks after others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"The most useless people are pitiful."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:28.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"They will definitely be used."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She always has such amusing misconceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:33.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sure is an amusing misconception, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though the most useless people are just the most foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't say that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:40.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was written all over your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:41.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:43.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having predicted that you'd say that, I already wrote it on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way in hell are you that well prepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-san was also helped by Oshino-san before as well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could say that, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I think he's more or less trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.55,0:07:03.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not just my testimony.\NHanekawa says so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.51,0:07:07.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.47,0:07:15.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I could believe him that easily, I would have been tricked countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I can never have such optimistic thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You took the time to put it on; why remove it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot to dry my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... Could it be that you're just an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't speak such rude words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could hurt my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mentioned optimism just now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:47.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that how it goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:52.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But being optimistic isn't a bad thing, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:54.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like you're doing anything bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:55.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's also not like you're cheating either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not doing anything bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:02.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that so?\NThat's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:04.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:06.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It may be considered a form of cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:07.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NNothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:14.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Araragi-kun.\NMay I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you mean when you said it's comparable to the pattern on the moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:22.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say that to Oshino-san back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:27.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is said that when you see the moon in Japan, its patterns resemble rabbits pounding rice cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:32.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whereas abroad, a crab or a beautiful woman can be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:34.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you know such useless things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the first time since birth that I've admired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:44.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just familiar with astronomy and cosmology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:47.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.\NThere's no need to act cool in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, you don't know about anything else, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:52.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you aware of what verbal abuse is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should tell that to the police officer in charge of verbal abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:09:00.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only want to show me that proud body of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:03.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Proud body of mine?\NI'm not that arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:08.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just not used to wearing clothes.\NThey're heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:12.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I didn't think you would be so knowledgeable, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might actually be possible that there is a brain inside your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:18.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:20.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:25.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A creature like you having a brain residing in his skull...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:28.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...is already a miracle in and of itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... think I am really stupid, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:36.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're actually expressing genuine shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.33,0:09:43.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of my carelessness, Araragi-kun realized that his brain is slower than others'.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:44.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel so guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:49.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is my stupidity level really that grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:52.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My standardized test score is seventy-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine's forty-six...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.89,0:09:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When rounded, it becomes zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:09:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NLiar. Forty-six would round up to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you rounded from the tens place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:05.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could you do that to my standardized test score?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One hundred.\NI can't grasp the sense of victory without expanding the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.65,0:10:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You also rounded your own score from the tens place...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:14.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:19.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If everything goes well, let's visit Hokkaido to eat crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:22.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that would be fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:23.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will be going as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crab is very delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:04.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino-san, you were a priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though it was my specialization in university, I have not been employed by any shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:11.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought over a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:16.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look like you've been purified nicely, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is quite well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:21.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just to confirm, are you wearing make-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:24.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought it best not to, hence I did not put any on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:27.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your judgment is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:29.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Has Araragi-kun taken a shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I took a shower at Senjougahara's place.\NNo problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:36.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You still haven't improved, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:37.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say such unnecessary things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Oshino...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this crab or whatever easy to exorcise?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your way of thinking is really violent, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:52.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did anything good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinobu-chan and that nymphomaniac cat attacked you and that class representative out of malice...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's not the case with the crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.35,0:12:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:06.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't I say that the opponent is a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As such, we are not going to exorcise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starting now, we are going to pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your attitudes must be respectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:16.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it something that can be returned if prayed for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:20.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,weight.\NBody mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.03,0:12:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:26.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are not so stubborn as to reject desperate wishes from humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though, gods are a bunch of careless beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Careless, as in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:35.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't care about the personal problems of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.01,0:12:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In fact, gods can't even differentiate between the age, gender, or weight of the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that crab still beside me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:51.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's still right beside you.\NBut it's also everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to summon it, you need to follow step-by-step procedures.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.33,0:13:08.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both of you, look down at the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep your heads down.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place is already right in front of the god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:33.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Drinking sake seems to be able to shorten the distance to gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:35.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm underage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like you're drinking till you drop. Just take a sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:51.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's start by relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.42,0:13:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This position belongs to you.\NYou're standing in your rightful position.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:13:59.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:05.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes while continuing to tilt your head.\NBegin counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One.\NTwo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:16.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three.\NFour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Five.\NSix.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:21.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:22.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:28.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you calmed down?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:30.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, then answer my questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miss, what is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:39.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara Hitagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is the name of the school that you're attending?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Naoetsu Private High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:45.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When is your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,July 7th.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.01,0:14:49.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is your favorite novelist?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yumeno Kyuusaku. {Note: A surrealist Japanese author.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you tell us about an experience of failure you had as a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:56.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to reveal that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:57.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is your favorite classical music?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.65,0:15:00.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not very interested in music.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you feel when you graduated from elementary school?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.90,0:15:07.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I took it as nothing more than a transfer to middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.45,0:15:09.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I simply moved from one public school to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:11.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What type of person was your first love?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:13.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to reveal that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Up till now, what has been your most painful memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:20.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your most painful memory...\NWhat I'm asking is that you recall your worst memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-My mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:31.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:35.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She got immersed in a cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.19,0:15:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "is that all?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:42.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Continue.\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:49.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-A high-ranking cult member came to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom brought him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brought him there... What happened next?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He claimed that it was a ritual...\NI...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...was violated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.72,0:16:10.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He... attempted to rape me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:12.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said that he {\i1}attempted{\i0} to rape you, meaning it didn't happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:21.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I used a spiked shoe beside me to hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.77,0:16:27.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... my mom did not come to my rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:35.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I injured the high-ranking cult member, my mom was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mom was punished, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:44.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.\NBut I always find myself thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:51.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't resisted at that time, maybe my mother wouldn't have fallen into such a pathetic state.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then our relationship would not have been broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:58.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, miss, those are your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how heavy they are, they are things you must carry with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:05.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't push them onto someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:08.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pushing them onto someone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without looking away...\NOpen your eyes and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:28.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:32.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see it.\NIt's the same as that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same as that time.\NA huge crab.\NI can see a crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:44.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything.\NWhat about you Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.65,0:17:50.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I see it very clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:52.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:55.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then... isn't there something you need to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:18:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something I need to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:11.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:23.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what an impatient god.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:26.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an energetic fellow, I must say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:27.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did something good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Oshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:33.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got it.\NChange of plans.\NI have to do this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:50.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the end, this is still a question of self-reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If praying does not work, and words are ineffective...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:55.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...what's left is to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless, if it's disposed of like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:01.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...according to procedure, this problem will be solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For this case, I say that's one possible solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A possible solution?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:07.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I generally hate crabs...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...because they're hard to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:15.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Oshino-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:19.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait?\NWait for what, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:23.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just now, I was merely frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will do this properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:32.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then help yourself.\NGive it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:38.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And... thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:45.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.31,0:19:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because those are my thoughts, my feelings, and my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will carry them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are things that I should not have lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.03,0:20:02.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I beg you, may I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:20:02.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May I please have my weight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:06.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May I please have my mother back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems that when Senjougahara's mother got immersed in the cult,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.89,0:20:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara was a fifth grader.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She had a serious illness at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of her daughter's illness, Senjougahara's mother wanted to seek spiritual assurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:36.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Senjougahara managed to survive a major surgical operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:48.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But her mother became increasingly immersed in the cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.79,0:20:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, the relationship between Senjougahara and her mother became strained.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:55.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems that she stopped talking to her mother during her middle school years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:56.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:21:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just before graduation from middle school, an incident occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This resulted in...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:16.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the breaking up of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It became irreparable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was then that Senjougahara met a crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:29.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A weight crab... That sort of thing, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:32.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is also called an emotion god. {Note: This is word play on Omoshi Kani (Weight Crab) and Omoishi Kami (Emotion God).}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:37.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, a bond is formed through a combination of feelings and protection. {Note: More word play. Omoi (feelings) and Shigami (protection) becomes Shigarami (a bond).}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is to say, when Senjougahara met the crab,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:46.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she cut all ties to her mother so she could stop feeling troubled regarding such matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:49.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She stopped thinking about those feelings, and therefore lost weight. {Note: More word play. "Omoi" can mean both "weight" and "feelings."}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She chose to cheat herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:56.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It actually isn't such a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:22:00.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This case especially, since even if she gets her feelings back,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:05.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,her mother won't come back and the family will remain broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.91,0:22:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even then, even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of that, Senjougahara Hitagi wanted to take them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.79,0:22:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She begged to get them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:17.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those unbearable feelings of her mother, memories, and frustrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like what Oshino said, maybe nothing will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.76,0:22:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like nothing can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, it isn't a futile effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:31.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least I gained an important friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you referring to?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:36.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.36,0:22:39.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.57,0:22:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:44.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I apologize for all my actions up till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:51.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though saying such a thing now is shameless, if we can get along from now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:51.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:22:58.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right brother, it's morning now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about time you woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just went to sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.72,0:23:06.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were out all night, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.51,0:23:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:10.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the only person who hasn't had breakfast yet, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:10.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, bro—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But still, my body feels heavy.{\i0}\N{\i1}Do I have a fever or something?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.69,0:23:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I might as well mention it.{\i0}\N{\i1}My weight is 55 Kg.{\i0}\N{\i1}But...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.32,0:23:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.{\i0}\N{\i1}Gods really are careless creatures. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.00,0:25:02.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen.\NI'm Tsukihi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.63,0:25:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you say jungle-gyms nowadays...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.54,0:25:04.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've said it before!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:05.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you've said too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.38,0:25:06.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too much?\NWhat do you mean by "jungle"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.96,0:25:08.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not a jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.13,0:25:09.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about gym?\NIt's not a gym either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.51,0:25:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's false advertisement!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.43,0:25:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then can they name it so you can be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.80,0:25:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe something like "Despair Special"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.47,0:25:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's seriously sounds pretty bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.39,0:25:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then once again, let's start the preview riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.51,0:25:16.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.47,0:25:17.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a bus driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.60,0:25:19.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm the bus driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.48,0:25:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The three of us rode it in the first episode!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.56,0:25:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yep, we rode it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.65,0:25:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is the name of the person who drives your bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.65,0:25:24.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.07,0:25:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Mayoi Snail Part 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.07,0:25:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, the answer is your name.
